{
    "title": "Document Reader & PDF Editor",
    "description": "Document Reader is an <b>all-in-one</b> file viewer that helps you read and manage all formats of office files easily. <b>PDF, WORD, EXCEL, PPT, TXT, etc.</b> all supported.\r\n\r\nIt's very easy to use, and <b>compatible with all office formats</b>. Just open it, you'll see all your documents well organized in folders for <b>quick search</b> and view. Open Word, read PDF, manage all files <b>in one place</b> easily!\r\n\r\n<b>Why choose Document Reader</b>?\r\n\ud83d\udc4f <b>Support all formats</b> - PDF, DOC, DOCX, XLS, XLXS, PPT, TXT, PNG, JPG, RTF, etc.\r\n\ud83d\udc4f All document viewer/office viewer\r\n\ud83d\udc4f Read all documents anywhere, anytime with <b>just one click</b>\r\n\ud83d\udc4f Simple and clear file lists, easy to search and manage files\r\n\ud83d\udc4f <b>Bookmark</b> documents for quick access\r\n\ud83d\udc4f No internet required, read documents offline\r\n\r\nDownload this <b>simple, fast, lightweight</b> all document reader now, and you'll get a PDF reader, Word/Excel viewer, PPT viewer, all in one!\r\n\r\nDocument Reader can work as: \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd5 <b>PDF Reader/PDF Viewer</b>\r\n- Zoom in/zoom out pages while reading\r\n- Jump to the page you want directly\r\n- Switch from landscape and portrait reading mode freely\r\n- Easily print and share PDFs\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd8 <b>Word Reader</b>\r\n- Handy document viewer for all DOC, DOCX, and DOCS files\r\n- Easily find your target file through quick search feature\r\n- Sort all documents by file path, size, name, last edit date, etc.\r\n- Simple and elegant interface\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc8 <b>Excel/Text Viewer</b>\r\n- Quickly open XLS, XLSX, TXT files and search out the data you want\r\n- A simple and straightforward way to read spreadsheets on your device\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d <b>PPT Viewer</b>\r\n- Viewing PPT, PPTX, PPS, PPSX files has never been easier\r\n- Fast and stable performance, HD quality\r\n\r\n\u27a1\ufe0f More features on the way\u2026\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Image to PDF converter\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Edit documents freely\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Support more document formats, RAR, ZIP, MOBI, HTML, etc.\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Night mode\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Search text within documents\r\n\u2026\r\n\r\nTry Document Reader now and you can read, edit and manage documents in all formats on the go!\r\n\r\nThank you for choosing Document Reader. \ud83d\udc97 We welcome all feedback and suggestions. If you have any questions, don't hesitate to contact us at allreaderappfeedback@gmail.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Document Reader is an <b>all-in-one</b> file viewer that helps you read and manage all formats of office files easily. <b>PDF, WORD, EXCEL, PPT, TXT, etc.</b> all supported.<br><br>It&#39;s very easy to use, and <b>compatible with all office formats</b>. Just open it, you&#39;ll see all your documents well organized in folders for <b>quick search</b> and view. Open Word, read PDF, manage all files <b>in one place</b> easily!<br><br><b>Why choose Document Reader</b>?<br>\ud83d\udc4f <b>Support all formats</b> - PDF, DOC, DOCX, XLS, XLXS, PPT, TXT, PNG, JPG, RTF, etc.<br>\ud83d\udc4f All document viewer/office viewer<br>\ud83d\udc4f Read all documents anywhere, anytime with <b>just one click</b><br>\ud83d\udc4f Simple and clear file lists, easy to search and manage files<br>\ud83d\udc4f <b>Bookmark</b> documents for quick access<br>\ud83d\udc4f No internet required, read documents offline<br><br>Download this <b>simple, fast, lightweight</b> all document reader now, and you&#39;ll get a PDF reader, Word/Excel viewer, PPT viewer, all in one!<br><br>Document Reader can work as: <br><br>\ud83d\udcd5 <b>PDF Reader/PDF Viewer</b><br>- Zoom in/zoom out pages while reading<br>- Jump to the page you want directly<br>- Switch from landscape and portrait reading mode freely<br>- Easily print and share PDFs<br><br>\ud83d\udcd8 <b>Word Reader</b><br>- Handy document viewer for all DOC, DOCX, and DOCS files<br>- Easily find your target file through quick search feature<br>- Sort all documents by file path, size, name, last edit date, etc.<br>- Simple and elegant interface<br><br>\ud83d\udcc8 <b>Excel/Text Viewer</b><br>- Quickly open XLS, XLSX, TXT files and search out the data you want<br>- A simple and straightforward way to read spreadsheets on your device<br><br>\ud83d\udd0d <b>PPT Viewer</b><br>- Viewing PPT, PPTX, PPS, PPSX files has never been easier<br>- Fast and stable performance, HD quality<br><br>\u27a1\ufe0f More features on the way\u2026<br>\u2714\ufe0f Image to PDF converter<br>\u2714\ufe0f Edit documents freely<br>\u2714\ufe0f Support more document formats, RAR, ZIP, MOBI, HTML, etc.<br>\u2714\ufe0f Night mode<br>\u2714\ufe0f Search text within documents<br>\u2026<br><br>Try Document Reader now and you can read, edit and manage documents in all formats on the go!<br><br>Thank you for choosing Document Reader. \ud83d\udc97 We welcome all feedback and suggestions. If you have any questions, don&#39;t hesitate to contact us at allreaderappfeedback@gmail.com.",
